  "title": "ON THE COMPUTATION OF THE DIFFERENCE GALOIS GROUPS OF ORDER THREE EQUATIONS",
  "authors_raw": "THOMAS DREYFUS AND MARINA POULET",
  "title_lines": [
   "ON THE COMPUTATION OF THE DIFFERENCE GALOIS GROUPS OF ORDER",
   "THREE EQUATIONS"
  ],
  "abstract": "In this paper we consider the problem of computing the di\ufb00erence Galois groups of order three equations for a large class of di\ufb00erence operators including the shift operator (Case S), the q-di\ufb00erence operator (Case Q), the Mahler operator (Case M) and the elliptic case (Case E). We show that the general problem can be reduced to several ancillary problems. We prove criteria to detect the irreducible and imprimitive Galois groups. Finally, we give a su\ufb03cient condition of di\ufb00erential transcendence of solutions of order three di\ufb00erence equations. We also compute the di\ufb00erence Galois group of an equation suggested by Wadim Zudilin.",
